"""AI-BS Native Studio Comprehensive Interactive Audit & Hardware Verification Engine.

Initializes Qt in offscreen mode, performs static AST inspection across all *_view.py modules,
executes runtime QTest interactions behind a dry run safety gate across all 46 subtabs,
queries NVML/WASAPI/system hardware telemetry, and benchmarks the 20 Ecosystem ports alongside
live HTTP JSON handshakes.
"""

